{
  "id": "c1-e26-young-people-and-politics",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Young people and politics",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how interested are people of your age in politics?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think the opinions of young people are taken seriously?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what issues matter most to young people nowadays?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, where do you get your information about political issues?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e26-a1",
            "c1-e26-a2",
            "c1-e26-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show young people engaging with political issues. Choose two of the pictures and say why the young people might feel strongly about these issues, and how effective their actions could be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 14300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of getting involved do you find the most convincing?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e26-b1",
            "c1-e26-b2",
            "c1-e26-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people taking part in politics. Choose two of the pictures and say what motivates these people, and what difficulties they could face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you ever consider a career in politics?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to encourage young people to take part in politics, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e26-young-people-and-politics",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas encourage more young people to take an interest in politics?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e26-young-people-and-politics",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most successful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about young people and politics.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is lack of interest in politics among young people a problem?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should the voting age be lowered to sixteen?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, can social media campaigns achieve real political change?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Do you think politicians understand the concerns of younger people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it better to protest or to work within the political system?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how can young people be protected from political misinformation?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e26-young-people-and-politics/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
